cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Entropic Image Contrast Measure"
abstract: >-
  A reference-free image contrast metric based on the mutual information between
  image intensity and its equalized histogram. Outperforms the Global Contrast
  Factor (GCF) on subtle exposure changes. Developed in the context of
  media-forensics research (DARPA MediFor).
type: software
